        "TileImage": "$($repository d262ec9c-97d0-4d92-97a6-f2f9e0378b86).Image",
        "Description": "A group of employees from the Kronstadt Raceway have recently noticed striking similarities in bulllet holes and casings throughout the world. These, of cource, are ICA custom rounds, and we must prevent our involvement in these deaths from reaching public eyes. Your mission, 47: Deal with the leaders of this reasearch, and dont leave bullet holes. We cant let them know this was us.",
